WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.199
In a lakehouse workflow we often save curated
results as a table This

00:00:06.226 --> 00:00:11.948
example creates a monthly sales table from raw sales
data The important

00:00:11.974 --> 00:00:17.522
design choice is the output grain one row per month
and product In

00:00:17.548 --> 00:00:22.995
a real Spark environment you would also think about
table format location and refresh process
